From 259e5a61215dc90c8cdd9269e60abff879d81eeb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 05:27:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2264/2271] drm/rockchip: dw_dp: Attach the "color format"
 connector property

The DW DP bridge offers RGB, YCbCr 4:4:4, 4:2:2 and 4:2:0 output
(dw_dp_output_formats[]) and the bridge chain bus format negotiation in
drm_atomic_bridge_chain_select_bus_fmts() already skips every output
bus format that does not match conn_state->color_format. The connector
never exposes the "color format" property though, so userspace cannot
ask for anything but the driver's own choice (RGB, or YCbCr 4:2:0 when
the link or a downstream TMDS converter cannot carry RGB).

Attach the property with the four formats of the output format table.
With the default "AUTO" value the negotiation is unchanged. A format
the sink, the link bandwidth or a protocol converter cannot carry is
rejected by the existing checks in
dw_dp_bridge_atomic_get_output_bus_fmts(), as for every other
unsupported configuration.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/dw_dp-rockchip.c | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/dw_dp-rockchip.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/dw_dp-rockchip.c
index 636d921f4877..fe3eed1c06b6 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/dw_dp-rockchip.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/dw_dp-rockchip.c
@@ -223,6 +223,21 @@ static int dw_dp_rockchip_bind(struct device *dev, struct device *master, void *
 		return ret;
 	}
 
+	/*
+	 * The bridge chain bus format negotiation already honours the
+	 * requested color format; these are the formats the DW DP output
+	 * format table offers.
+	 */
+	ret = drm_connector_attach_color_format_property(connector,
+							 BIT(DRM_OUTPUT_COLOR_FORMAT_RGB444) |
+							 BIT(DRM_OUTPUT_COLOR_FORMAT_YCBCR444) |
+							 BIT(DRM_OUTPUT_COLOR_FORMAT_YCBCR422) |
+							 BIT(DRM_OUTPUT_COLOR_FORMAT_YCBCR420));
+	if (ret) {
+		dw_dp_unbind(dp->base);
+		return ret;
+	}
+
 	drm_connector_attach_hdr_output_metadata_property(connector);
 
 	ret = drm_mode_create_dp_colorspace_property(connector,
-- 
